{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：23:23 2026-06-06 HKT<br/>發佈時間：23:23 2026-06-06 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：23:23 2026-06-06 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/50858a908b9dbf50578405ce985b77bc/2026-06/013.png\"/><p>今日（6日）晚上10時32分，警方接獲報案，指旺角塘尾道66至68號福強工業大廈一單位有煙冒出，懷疑發生火警。消防出動一條喉及一隊煙帽隊灌救，其間亦架起雲梯進行搜查，至晚上11時正將火救熄。事件中，大約10人自行疏散，無人受傷，據了解疑有雜物及拖板起火肇禍。</p><img alt=\"消防架起雲梯進行搜查。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9759a9277cebc44f341838381684b977/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-06_at_23_07_19.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"塘尾道66至68號福強工業大廈一單位發生火警。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4f1c225025b4bab31af1f1ccada2206a/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-06_at_23_07_20.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"塘尾道66至68號福強工業大廈一單位發生火警。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fcc940601de970ef570be8b42adb1035/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-06_at_23_07_20_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防架起雲梯進行搜查。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1d635a3cb01903f6d5189aeac3cc72e0/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-06_at_23_07_20_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6612a027c12871ddbd34666cffd07190/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-06_at_23_13_39.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為旺角塘尾道66至68號福強工業大廈。黃文威攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b051e151da644e0db19cd55995da32a2/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-06_at_23_07_18.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-06T15:42:39.073151+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}